  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.3.0: the place list is rebuilt from the Census 2000 places file. Earlier versions cut a name at the first \"town\", \"city\", \"village\" or similar anywhere in it (Georgetown was listed as George, Felicity as Feli); 16,969 names now, and almost every seeded place name differs from 2.2.0. Person and star names are unchanged. Full history: https://github.com/m4bwav/DotNetRandomNameGenerator/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
